      "DispTime" : 0,
      "DispType" : 0,
      "GmdIndex" : 14,
      "JumpGroupSerial" : 0,
      "Message" : {
        "En" : "As a guideline, when you reach job level 18,\r\nuntil then, don't think about anything else and\r\ncontinue to practice the lance.",
        "Jp" : "目安としては――\r\nジョブレベルが１８になった頃か\r\nそれまでは余計なことは考えず\r\nひたすら鍛錬に励むように"
      },
      "MsgSerial" : 543310,
